# V0.5-Joker Strict Zero-Trust Sandbox Preset
L1 SANDBOX * 1
L1 LOCK /etc/* 1
L1 LOCK C:\Windows\* 1
L1 LOCK C:\Users\* 1
L1 DENY powershell 1
L1 DENY cmd 1
L1 DENY bash 1
L1 DENY sh 1
L1 DENY curl 1
L1 DENY wget 1
L1 REDACT sk-* 1
L1 REDACT ghp_* 1
L1 BREAK 2
L1 TIMEOUT 15
L1 REWARD safe_probe 10
L1 PENALIZE unsafe_action -20
L1 ROLLBACK * 1
L1 RESET * 1
L1 ATTACH sandbox 1
L1 WATCH sandbox 1
L1 CHECKPOINT * 1
L1 AUDIT * 1
